    "drs:title": "Prohibition on Personal Use of Electronic Devices on the Flight Deck",
    "drs:nprmSummary": "The proposed rule would prohibit flightcrew members in operations under part 121 from using a personal wireless communications device or laptop computer for personal use while at their duty station on the flight deck while the aircraft is being operated. This rule, which conforms FAA regulations wit",
